    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "size": [
        320,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Sketch outline + dots\n- Sketch Outline: combined = XDoG pencil lines from the frames + silhouettes from the depth. background_fade (needs depth) keeps lines on the people/subject; raise epsilon for fewer lines, sigma for bolder; line_thickness / line_strength for weight.\n- Keep Sketch Outline 'scale' = Stipple Render 'scale' (Combine resizes anyway).\n- Combine 'auto': dark lines multiplied over light dots, light lines screened over dark (dark) renders. line_color e.g. #c03020 paints colored lines. dots_masked_by_lines = lines drawn with dots.\n- The saved name gets the outline settings appended, e.g. ..._combined_ls1_lt1.\n\nDepthDots tips\n- Faces: model large, res 1036, detail 1.5, shade 0.3 (Enhance).\n- More/denser dots: raise dots; gamma >1 pushes dots to close areas; floor = background density.\n- color_mode: depth_shaded (tone = depth), flat (solid ink), source_color (needs source_image).\n- dark = white dots on black. size_by_depth = closer dots bigger.\n- Have a depth map already? LoadImage -> DepthDots Depth From Image -> Enhance/Render (see depth_map_in workflow).\n- The SaveImage filename_prefix comes from the Render node: <prefix>_<model>_r<res>_n<dots>_g.._s.._x..[_det.._sh..][_fixed][_dark][_color]..."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
